<title>USA: U.S. soybean oil export breakdown.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean oil export breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce Department breakdown of soybean oil exports (tonnes):</p>
<p> -			Aug96   July96    Aug95</p>
<p> -	   Crude    6,874    5,338   17,039</p>
<p> -  Once Refined	390    1,118    3,526</p>
<p> - Fully Refined    5,302    4,716   27,401</p>
